                    {
                        "form_id": "98bb7468-9d5a-463d-bec1-8c5cfaa92761",
                        "entry_id": "24a56d38-92d1-3042-aa4c-a6db731a768e",
                        "tags": [
                            "participle",
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "gronked"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "631f286f-9627-4050-af14-0e99d84fb2f3",
                        "entry_id": "24a56d38-92d1-3042-aa4c-a6db731a768e",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "gronked"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "24f2963c-101f-3137-9aa9-d0c9c616e395",
                        "entry_id": "24a56d38-92d1-3042-aa4c-a6db731a768e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of a floppy disk drive: to produce mechanical sounds of operation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d3c81c2-48fe-43b8-bd3e-5f2c6d7398b3",
                                "sense_id": "24f2963c-101f-3137-9aa9-d0c9c616e395",
                                "text": "They say a good detective always starts at the beginning, so I installed the program on my VGA PC's hard drive. As the computer gronked away, copying six 5¼-inch floppies, I wondered why, if bad detectives start at the end, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1db6ba6-a72b-46ff-8002-27bdd9b0620d",
                                "sense_id": "24f2963c-101f-3137-9aa9-d0c9c616e395",
                                "text": "[…] a disk drive gronked, her screen bloomed, and suddenly there was an icon in the upper right corner."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc931c5a-ac7b-48d2-b7ee-006feeb7b5ed",
                                "sense_id": "24f2963c-101f-3137-9aa9-d0c9c616e395",
                                "text": "The next startup event is the computer's attempt to read a disk in drive A. But, there is no disk in drive A, remember? You were supposed to remove any disk in this drive. So, you hear a lot of pathetic gronking and grakking until the computer gives up […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c5c43052-6ca6-3599-b131-bee37fcb7474",
                        "entry_id": "24a56d38-92d1-3042-aa4c-a6db731a768e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To fail; to crash or go wrong."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive",
                            "rare",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f38a0e9-2693-4241-8fc4-fb6c2a4b9764",
                                "sense_id": "c5c43052-6ca6-3599-b131-bee37fcb7474",
                                "text": "Repeats the last 40 lines of IRC output, in case your terminal gronked."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3fb53aa0-95b4-4bb1-89b7-e48f9bd682ce",
                                "sense_id": "c5c43052-6ca6-3599-b131-bee37fcb7474",
                                "text": "The other faction centered on […] what went on under the [model railway] layout. This was The System, […] and it was constantly being improved, revamped, perfected, and sometimes \"gronked\"—in club jargon, screwed up."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
